---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | CraftGrid"
  description="CraftGrid prototype platform privacy policy and data governance."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8">
    
    <div class="border-b border-border pb-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-dark tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-secondary mt-1">Last revised: September 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-border text-slate-700 text-xs font-medium leading-relaxed">
      CraftGrid takes your privacy and project confidentiality seriously. This Privacy Policy explains our commitment to protecting your business information and project assets.
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-sm text-secondary space-y-4 text-xs leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-dark">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        CraftGrid collects user profile information (such as name, email address, portfolio assets, and business details) strictly necessary to facilitate matching between website builders and clients.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-dark">2. Payment Data & Security</h2>
      <p>
        CraftGrid adheres to rigorous payment security standards. All card and banking transactions are tokenized and processed through certified PCI-DSS Level 1 compliant financial infrastructure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-dark">3. Cookies and Session Management</h2>
      <p>
        Our platform utilizes essential cookies and browser session storage to maintain authentication states, preserve draft project briefs, and remember your account preferences.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
